  "proofBoundary": "Direct retail-byte execution proof for the 915 GfxWorld surface materials in the three retained MP worlds mp_nuketown_2020, mp_raid, and mp_hijacked. It walks nested FOLLOW GfxImage records, validates Material stateBitsEntry/constants/sampler-bearing texture records and full 20-byte GfxStateBits records, and checks the 8-byte loadBits vocabulary against exact T6 enum ranges. Archive roots hash each complete serialized Material byte range. It does not claim closure for the 28 missing hash-pinned MP maps, non-world/layered component materials, numeric backend polygon bias, technique selection, or visual playback parity.",
